    {
      "name": "Nuvio",
      "bundleIdentifier": "com.devpersaud.nuvio",
      "developerName": "devpersaud06",
      "subtitle": "Media app with Netflix-style adaptive quality.",
      "localizedDescription": "Bring your own sources. Nuvio turns them into a library with artwork, ratings, subtitles, and your place saved on every screen.\n\nWHAT'S DIFFERENT IN THIS BUILD\n\n\u2022 Adaptive quality, like Netflix\nNuvio measures your connection while you watch. When it slows down, playback moves to a lighter source at the exact same moment; when it recovers, it climbs back up. Switches happen silently, with no reload, no loading screen and no pop-ups.\n\n\u2022 Seamless swaps\nA hidden second player prepares the new quality in the background, checks it is the same cut of the video, and takes over on the exact frame, so the picture just gets sharper or softer.\n\n\u2022 Quality menu\nTap the quality pill in the player to choose Auto or lock a resolution (2160p, 1080p, 720p, 480p). If a source for that quality doesn't match the video, Nuvio tries another one before giving up.\n\n\u2022 Fast start\nIf your chosen source is slow to open, playback starts on 720p straight away and steps up to your pick a few seconds later.\n\n\u2022 Scrub previews\nDrag the timeline to see a thumbnail of the frame you're seeking to.\n\n\u2022 Instant next episode\nDuring the next-episode countdown, the next episode is loaded in the background so it starts with no wait.\n\nNOTES\n\n\u2022 Installs alongside the official Nuvio app (separate bundle ID).\n\u2022 Sign in with your Nuvio account to sync your library, progress and addons.\n\u2022 Nuvio is free software under GPL-3.0. Based on NuvioMedia/NuvioMobile 0.6.2.",
      "iconURL": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NuvioMedia/NuvioMobile/0.4.11/iosApp/iosApp/Assets.xcassets/AppIcon.appiconset/app-icon-1024.png",
      "tintColor": "#1E88E5",
